71	// Claude Code writes the session as JSONL at data.transcript_path. The last
72	// message carrying a usage block tells us how many tokens are currently in the
73	// context window. We tail the file so large sessions stay cheap. Returns 0 when
74	// the session is fresh (no usage yet) so the green LED still shows.
